===Etymology===
{{translit|en|ar|مُحَمَّد|t=[[praise]]d, [[commendable]], [[laudable]]}}, the passive participle of {{m|ar|حَمَّدَ||to [[praise]], [[commend]], [[laud]], [[extol]]}}. From the same triconsonantal root {{ar-root|ح|م|د|nocat=1}} as, but distinct from, {{m|en|Mahmud}}.
